<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Kookmin Bank 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Kookmin Bank 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			1,648     vs     1,039</p>
<p>    Net				  163.6   vs	  101.9</p>
<p>    Turnover			 2,868.1   vs	2,336.9</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		164.8   vs	  103.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (cash, pct)	    12.12  vs	    3</p>
<p>		 (stocks, pct)	   none  vs	    2.89</p>
<p>NOTE - Kookmin Bank said its share capital rose to 92.88 million in 1996 from 78.20 million a year earlier due to bonus issues and global depository receipts. -- Seoul Newsroom</p>
</text>
